---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Who writes AIStackHub and how we test the tools we review."
>
  <div class="wrap section-head prose" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h1>About AIStackHub</h1>

    <p>
      AIStackHub is written by <strong>Zaiedd</strong>, an AI practitioner and
      student based in Egypt. I work with AI tools every day, study how they
      behave, and help friends, colleagues, and readers grow with them.
    </p>

    <h2>Why I started this</h2>
    <p>
      New AI tools appear faster than anyone can test them. Most "best tool"
      lists are copy-pasted from press releases — no one actually used the thing
      they're recommending. I started AIStackHub so the next hour you spend
      hunting for a tool doesn't turn into three wasted ones on the wrong pick.
    </p>

    <h2>How I test</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Hands-on only.</strong> Every review comes from actually using the tool on a real task — studying, coding, or running a small business.</li>
      <li><strong>Timed and honest.</strong> I note what each tool is good at and where it fails, instead of grading everything "8/10".</li>
      <li><strong>No press-release reviews.</strong> If I'm unsure about something, I say so rather than guessing.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Tool reviews for <strong>students</strong>, <strong>developers</strong>, and <strong>business owners</strong>.</li>
      <li>Head-to-head <strong>comparisons</strong> when the choice actually matters.</li>
      <li>Honest verdicts — the part worth screenshotting.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      If a tool helped you move forward, I want you to find it here fast — and if
      one wasted your time, I want you to skip it even faster.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>